# GEMINI_API_KEY: khoa goi tro ly AI trong ung dung Gia Dinh Viet.
#
# KHONG dat khoa that vao file nay — file nay duoc commit len GitHub, va GitHub
# Release cua repo nay cong khai. Khoa nam trong classes.dex cua APK giai duoc
# bang chuoi plain, ai tai ve cung lay duoc va tieu tien tai khoan Google.
#
# Thu tuc dung:
#  1. GitHub: Settings -> Secrets and variables -> Actions -> Repository secrets
#     tao secret TEN `GEMINI_API_KEY`, dan khoa AI Studio vao do.
#  2. Workflow `.github/workflows/build-apk.yml` ghi file `.env` (da bi
#     .gitignore) tu secret do TRUOC khi build; secrets plugin sinh
#     `BuildConfig.GEMINI_API_KEY` tu `.env`.
#  3. Build ma khong co secret thi APK van chay: duoi chiem cho ben duoi khiem
#     kiem tra cua `AiKey.isUsable`, va man hinh "Tro ly gia dinh" hoi khoa.
#     Nguoi dung dan khoa mot lan tren may — luu trong SharedPreferences rieng
#     cua app, khong di qua bat cu repo nao.
#
# Gia tri duoi day CHUAN TOAN la chuoi chiem cho, khong phai credential.
# Giu no du de truong BuildConfig luoan ton tai khi bien dich.
GEMINI_API_KEY=REPLACE_ME_WITH_YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY
